<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-v3-fixed-carriers:3> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Read only three opt-in named committed carriers, their exact approved remote identities, revisions, 40-hex Git tree OIDs from git rev-parse revision tree, listed tracked paths and blobs. Source and parser digests are SHA-256 of raw bytes; remote identity digest is SHA-256 of the exact approved canonical UTF-8 identity preimage, matched without reading, retaining or outputting a credential URL. The input binds each selected N-Quads path/blob to one strict-IRI lexical-profile expected graph IRI and binds a TypeScript parser name, version, entrypoint raw digest and non-absolute resolver identity." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-symbol-assurance-observer> .
