<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-v3-selection:3> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The portable v3 envelope contains the complete immutable parser asset selection, N-Quads asset-to-expected-graph bindings and six assurance predicate IRIs. Its selection digest is SHA-256 of canonical selection JSON excluding only its own digest field; a digest alone is insufficient." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-symbol-assurance-observer> .
