<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-v3-resources:3> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-symbol-assurance-observer> .
<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-v3-resources:3> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use one temporary cgroup for extraction and descendants with MemoryMax 536870912 bytes, CPUQuota 100 percent, 30000 millisecond wall deadline and concurrency one. V3 additionally limits 1500 tracked paths, 300 parser paths, 16MiB parser input, 128 N-Quads sources, 256KiB each, 1000 quads each, 8000 aggregate quads, 3000 symbols, 1000 declared edges, 300 assurance links and 2MiB output." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-symbol-assurance-observer> .
